<pre class="http-req"><code class="language-http">GET /jsp-include/java?f=tinh&amp;from=String+user&amp;to=%3C%2Fhtml%3E HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:8080
Cookie: JSESSIONID=…</code></pre>
