<p>Read the measured lines: on a collection, <code>begin="1" end="4" step="2"</code> are <strong>positions</strong> (items 1 and 3: CSD201, PRO192); in the counting form <code>var</code> holds the number itself and <code>index</code> equals it (1, 4, 7, 10) while <code>count</code> is still 1, 2, 3, 4; <code>begin &gt; end</code> simply makes zero rounds.</p>
