<p>Everything from slides 7–15 works together here: <code>varStatus</code> numbers the rows (<code>st.count</code>) and gives zebra classes (<code>st.index % 2</code>) and a class for the last row (<code>st.last</code>); <code>c:out</code> makes the product <code>Cáp "USB-C" &lt;2m&gt; &amp; sạc nhanh</code> safe (<code>&amp;#034;</code>, <code>&amp;lt;</code>, <code>&amp;amp;</code>); a <code>c:choose</code> inside the loop prints the stock status; <code>c:set</code> accumulates the stock value (<code>p.thanhTien</code> is a computed getter, no such field exists); <code>fmt:formatNumber</code> prints Vietnamese money (3.E); <code>c:url</code> + <code>c:param</code> build the edit links (3.E). The search keeps the typed text and the selected category:</p>
