<p class="lead">Lesson 3.D covered the core tags you write on every page. The second half of the deck is wider and thinner: the URL tags (<code>c:import</code>, <code>c:url</code>, <code>c:redirect</code>, <code>c:param</code>), the <code>fmt</code> library for languages, numbers and dates, then one slide each for <code>sql</code>, three for <code>x</code>, two lists of <code>fn</code> functions, and the slide on installing JSTL — which no longer works as written. Every tag below runs on Tomcat 10.1 with JSTL 3.0; where a slide is wrong or out of date, the lesson says so and shows the measured error.</p>
